# admin.<domen> faqat shu manzillardan ochiladi (ofis, VPN, uy IP'si). Nusxa oling:
#   cp infra/edge/conf.d/admin-allow.caddy.example infra/edge/conf.d/admin-allow.caddy
# va manzillarni almashtiring (IPv4/IPv6, yakka manzil yoki CIDR; bo'sh joy bilan). Keyin ildiz .env ga:
#   EDGE_ADMIN_ACCESS=/etc/caddy/conf.d/admin-allow.caddy
# va `docker compose up -d edge`. Bu fayl serverda qoladi (git'da emas: *.caddy .gitignore'da).
# Diqqat: ro'yxatda o'zingizning joriy IP'ingiz bo'lsin, aks holda o'zingiz ham kira olmaysiz.
@admin_denied not remote_ip 203.0.113.10/32 198.51.100.0/24
handle @admin_denied {
	respond "Forbidden" 403
}
